  "custom_logic_notes": "The 'Camel' strategy combines CCI level crossovers with MACD histogram/signal line confirmation and a moving average trend filter. Long entry requires CCI crossing above -100, MACD main above signal, and price above MA. Short entry requires CCI crossing below 100, MACD main below signal, and price below MA. Opposite positions are closed before opening a new position in the reverse direction. The LotSize function uses a conditional sizing model: negative input lots = fixed lot size, positive input lots = fraction of free margin. All SL/TP/Trailing values are adjusted by a factor of 10 for 5-digit (3-digit JPY) brokers.",
