  "backtest_data_needs": "M1",
  "python_conversion_notes": "Three indicators needed: CCI(period=14, typical price), MACD(12,26,9, close), SMA(period=14, close). Entry is a 3-condition AND gate: CCI crossover of level +/-100, MACD main vs signal direction, and price vs MA direction. Signal evaluated once per new bar. SL/TP are fixed-pip with 10x adjustment for 5-digit brokers. Trailing stop is simple fixed-pip step. Position sizing has dual mode (fixed vs margin-fraction). Reverse signal closes opposite position. No complex order management or pending orders.",
